{
    "title": "Cube Block - Woody Puzzle Game",
    "description": "Cube Block - Woody Puzzle Game is a classic addictive puzzle game. Relax while this wood block puzzle game gently trains your brain. Enjoy cube block puzzle game by solving wooden block puzzles.\r\n\r\nJust match the woody blocks and solve the wooden block puzzles! Cube Block - Woody Puzzle Game is a relaxing cube block puzzle game. Solving wood block puzzles is great for stress relieving while challenging yourself.\r\n \r\nWooden Block Puzzle Gameplay:\r\n-Place the wood blocks onto the board\r\n-Stack cube blocks vertically & horizontally to smash them\r\n-Once you can't place any more blocks, the round is over!\r\n-Match as many blocks as you can to get a higher score!\r\n \r\nHighlights\r\n1. Detailed, handcrafted wooden block puzzle games\r\n2. Easy to play; one hand is all you need\r\n3. Minimal design for this classic wood block puzzle game\r\n4. No time limit; take your time with the block puzzles\r\n5. Wi-Fi free; you can still enjoy this wood block puzzle game offline\r\n6. Small file size; available for most devices\r\n \r\nHow to play:\r\nMatch and stack the wooden blocks vertically & horizontally to smash and get rid of them. Once there's no more space for new wooden blocks, the round is over! This wooden block puzzle game seems simple, but not easy to beat. However, there are always fun and relaxation playing wooden block puzzles.\r\n \r\nThis wood block puzzle game is just the type of relaxing game to challenge your IQ and your luck without giving you a headache. Play this wooden block puzzle game with your friends in leisure time and get close to each other! Give it a shot, download this cube block puzzle game now!",
